Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: omarchy
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy
Source: https://github.com/omacom/omarchy
Comment: The port (the oaxaca branch of the fork named in distro.conf) keeps Omarchy's
 MIT license. The Omarchy name is a trademark of the Omacom Foundation and is not used
 by the built packages: the build renames the tree to the distro's name and replaces
 Omarchy's logos with the distro's placeholders.

Files: *
Copyright: 2025-2026 Basecamp / Omacom (Omarchy contributors)
License: MIT

Files: default/fonts/*
Copyright: 2025-2026 Omarchy contributors (glyphs assembled with Fontello)
License: MIT
Comment: The icon font's README names the origin of each glyph: Omarchy's own mark,
 project marks from their public SVGs, and one Font Awesome glyph (staff-snake,
 CC BY 4.0). The build renames the family; the Omarchy mark at U+E900 stays until the
 distro supplies its own glyph.

Files: debian/*
Copyright: 2026 @DISTRO_NAME@ contributors
License: MIT

